{"sha": "5e6f5ed2df9803d65005056cef3d3a715ae71c724908b31b43ecbe5a08d19b63", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "当 $n = 1$ 时，应用 $\\eu^t \\geq 1 + t \\geq t$，并取 $t = x/2$，", "\\[", "\\frac{\\eu^x}{x} = \\frac{\\left(\\eu^{x/2}\\right)^2}{x}", "\\geq \\frac{(x/2)^2}{x} = \\frac{x}{4} \\xrightarrow[x\\to+\\infty]{} +\\infty .", "\\]", "对一般的 $n$，写作", "\\[", "\\frac{\\eu^x}{x^n}", "= \\frac{1}{n^n}\\left(\\frac{\\eu^{x/n}}{x/n}\\right)^{n}", "\\xrightarrow[x\\to+\\infty]{} +\\infty", "\\]", "由 $n=1$ 的情形及复合即得上式。$-\\infty$ 时的极限", "由代换 $x \\mapsto -x$ 得到：", "$\\abs{x^n \\eu^x} = \\frac{\\abs{x}^n}{\\eu^{\\abs x}} \\to 0$.", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=8.8cm, height=6cm,", "  xmin=-0.4, xmax=5.6, ymin=-12, ymax=155,", "  xtick={1,2,3,4,5}, ytick={50,100,150}]", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0:5.4] {x^2};", "  \\addplot[omProp, thick, domain=0:5.3] {x^3};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=-0.4:5.0] {exp(x)};", "  \\fill (axis cs:4.536,93.4) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\draw[black, dashed, thin] (axis cs:4.536,0) -- (axis cs:4.536,93.4);", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 指数函数（蓝色）最终超过每一个幂函数：它", "在较早处超过 $x^2$（红色），超过 $x^3$（橙色）则发生于 $x \\approx 4.54$ 处。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{自然对数}", "", "\\begin{definition}[自然对数]\\label{def:g12:exp:ln}", "指数函数连续且严格递增，是从 $\\R$ 到", "$\\intoo{0}{+\\infty}$ 的满射；由双射定理", "（\\cref{thm:g12:limcont:bijection}），对每个 $y > 0$，方程", "$\\eu^x = y$ 有唯一解。该解称为\\emph{自然对数}\\index{自然对数}，", "$y$ 的，记作 $\\ln y$。于是", "\\[", "\\text{对 } x \\in \\R,\\ y > 0: \\qquad y = \\eu^x \\iff x = \\ln y .", "\\]", "特别地，$\\ln 1 = 0$，$\\ln \\eu = 1$，并且", "$\\eu^{\\ln y} = y$, $\\ln(\\eu^x) = x$.", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=8.6cm, axis equal image,", "  xmin=-4.3, xmax=6.3, ymin=-4.3, ymax=6.3,", "  xtick={1}, ytick={1}]", "  \\addplot[black, dashed, domain=-3.9:5.9] {x};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=-4.1:1.79] {exp(x)};", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0.0167:5.9, samples=120] {ln(x)};", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small, anchor=east] at (axis cs:0.95,2.6) {$\\eu^x$};", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small, anchor=north] at (axis cs:4.3,1.25) {$\\ln x$};", "  \\node[font=\\small, anchor=west, rotate=45] at (axis cs:4.6,4.85) {$y=x$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small $\\exp$ 与 $\\ln$ 的图像关于", "直线 $y = x$ 互为镜像：点 $(x, \\eu^x)$ 反射为 $(\\eu^x, x)$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[代数性质]\\label{prop:g12:exp:lnalg}", "对所有 $a, b > 0$ 及 $n \\in \\Z$：", "\\[", "\\ln(ab) = \\ln a + \\ln b, \\quad", "\\ln\\frac{1}{a} = -\\ln a, \\quad", "\\ln\\frac{a}{b} = \\ln a - \\ln b, \\quad", "\\ln(a^n) = n \\ln a, \\quad", "\\ln\\sqrt{a} = \\tfrac12 \\ln a .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\eu^{\\ln a + \\ln b} = \\eu^{\\ln a}\\eu^{\\ln b} = ab$，两边取 $\\ln$", "即得第一式。其余等式同理，由", "\\cref{prop:g12:exp:funceq}中的相应恒等式推出。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[分析性质]\\label{prop:g12:exp:lnanalytic}", "函数 $\\ln$ 在 $\\intoo{0}{+\\infty}$ 上可导，且", "\\[", "(\\ln x)' = \\frac{1}{x},", "\\]", "严格递增、凹，并且", "$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0^+} \\ln x = -\\infty$,", "$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty} \\ln x = +\\infty$。此外，对每个整数", "$n \\geq 1$,", "\\[", "\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty} \\frac{\\ln x}{x^{1/n}} = 0, \\qquad", "\\lim_{x\\to0^+} x \\ln x = 0 .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "反函数的可导性在本阶段不加证明地承认；承认此点后，", "对恒等式 $\\eu^{\\ln x} = x$ 用链式法则求导：", "$(\\ln x)'\\,\\eu^{\\ln x} = 1$，故 $(\\ln x)' = \\frac{1}{x} > 0$，从而严格", "递增，又 $(\\ln x)'' = -\\frac1{x^2} < 0$，从而为凹。", "$0^+$ 与 $+\\infty$ 处的极限由双射与 $\\exp$ 的极限对应得到。对于增长比较，", "取 $x = \\eu^{t}$：", "$\\frac{\\ln x}{x} = \\frac{t}{\\eu^t} \\to 0$，当 $t \\to +\\infty$ 时，由", "\\cref{thm:g12:exp:growth}，类似地，对另一极限", "取 $x = \\eu^{-t}$，得 $x\\ln x = -t\\eu^{-t} \\to 0$。", "\\end{proof}", ""]}